T*
(                    DOCUMENT ID: QH-STRATO-2026-AMD1) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Amendment No. 1 \("Amendment"\) amends the Service Level Agreement dated) Tj
T*
(August 1, 2026, Document ID QH-STRATO-2026-SLA \(the "SLA"\), which is) Tj
T*
(incorporated by reference into the Cloud Service Agreement between StratoNode) Tj
T*
(Inc. \("Provider"\) and Quillhub Inc. \("Customer"\) dated August 1, 2026) Tj
T*
(\(Contract ID: QH-STRATO-2026-001, the "Agreement"\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Capitalized terms not defined in this Amendment have the meanings given in) Tj
T*
(the SLA, the Agreement, or the Standard Terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Except as expressly modified by this Amendment, the SLA remains in full force) Tj
T*
(and effect. In the event of a conflict between this Amendment and the SLA,) Tj
T*
(this Amendment controls.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(================================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AMENDMENT EFFECTIVE DATE:  January 1, 2027) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
