T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 1 ? MODIFICATION TO CREDIT REQUEST PROCEDURE) Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section 3.2 of the SLA is deleted in its entirety and replaced with the) Tj
T*
(following:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  "3.2  Credit Request Procedure. To receive a Service Credit, Customer must) Tj
T*
(        submit a written request to Provider's Notice Address within fifteen) Tj
T*
(        \(15\) days after the end of the calendar month in which the Downtime) Tj
T*
(        occurred. The request must include: \(a\) the specific dates and times) Tj
T*
(        of each Downtime incident; \(b\) a description of how the Cloud Service) Tj
T*
(        was affected; \(c\) evidence from Customer's own monitoring systems or) Tj
T*
(        Provider's status page; and \(d\) the calculated Monthly Uptime) Tj
T*
(        Percentage. Provider will review the request and respond within ten) Tj
T*
(        \(10\) business days. If Provider confirms that the Uptime Target was) Tj
T*
(        not met, Provider will apply the Service Credit to Customer's next) Tj
T*
(        invoice.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SECTION 2 ? MODIFICATION TO SERVICE CREDIT CALCULATION) Tj
T*
(-------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section 3.1 of the SLA is deleted in its entirety and replaced with the) Tj
T*
(following:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  "3.1  If the Monthly Uptime Percentage falls below the Uptime Target in any) Tj
T*
(        calendar month, Customer will be eligible for a Service Credit as) Tj
T*
(        specified in the table below:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(          Monthly Uptime Percentage          Service Credit) Tj
T*
(          ----------------------------       -------------------------) Tj
T*
(          99.0% to < 99.5%                   10% of Monthly Fee) Tj
T*
(          95.0% to < 99.0%                   25% of Monthly Fee) Tj
T*
(          Below 95.0%                        50% of Monthly Fee) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(        'Monthly Fee' for the purpose of this SLA means the monthly Fee) Tj
T*
(        payable under the Agreement, currently Eight Thousand U.S. Dollars) Tj
ET

